  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre T-FIGHT TEAM is a more accessible and forgiving version of the T-FIGHT concept, designed for regular and occasional players seeking power, spin and comfort. It features a 102 sq.in head, 285 g weight, 330 mm balance and a 16x19 string pattern. The larger RSX Section frame provides additional power compared with the standard T-FIGHT range, while Isoflex progressive stiffness enlarges the sweet spot and helps maintain consistent power and precision on both centered and off-center contact. The racquet is factory pre-strung with black synthetic gut and is ready to play.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre T-FIGHT TEAM 是标准 T-FIGHT 系列更容易驾驭、更高容错的版本，主要面向日常及休闲比赛球员。球拍采用102平方英寸拍面、285克重量、330毫米平衡点及16×19线床，在力量、旋转、舒适性与易打性之间取得优秀平衡。更大的 RSX Section 拍框结构相比标准 T-FIGHT 提供更多力量，而 Isoflex 渐进式刚性系统能够扩大甜区，使中心及非中心击球都保持较稳定的力量与精准度。该产品原厂预穿黑色 Synthetic Gut，可直接使用。"
  },

